+- **Mode 2 — poetry 2.x incompatible flag (seen 2026-10-26T18:29Z -> last failure 2026-10-27T22:50:54Z):**
+  `#12 ERROR: process "/bin/sh -c poetry config virtualenvs.in-project true && (test -f poetry.lock || poetry lock --no-update) && poetry install --no-interaction --no-ansi --only main --no-root"` -> `error: exit status 1`.
+  `poetry lock --no-update` was removed in poetry 2.x; the build installs `poetry==2.4.1` (per current Dockerfile `RUN pip install --no-cache-dir poetry==2.4.1`), so the RUN step always fails.
+- 33/50 error entries per service mention poetry.lock; both services fail symmetrically (worker mirrors primary within ~1s).
